{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21048","headline":"白虎行 · 李贺","name":"白虎行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"火乌日暗崩腾云，秦皇虎视苍生羣。\n烧书灭国无暇日，铸劒佩玦惟将军。\n玉坛设醮思冲天，一世二世当万年。\n烧丹未得不死药，拏舟海上寻神仙。\n鲸鱼张鬣海波沸，耕人半作征人鬼。\n雄豪气猛如焰烟，无人爲决天河水。\n谁最苦兮谁最苦，报人义士深相许。\n渐离击筑荆卿歌，荆卿把酒燕丹语。\n劒如霜兮胆如铁，出燕城兮望秦月。\n天授秦封祚未移，衮龙衣点荆卿血。\n朱旗卓地白虎死，汉皇知是真天子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}